  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-1da376c7-7fff-4b5d-769b-6cf016e2cf64&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey rear extension, by reason of its inappropriate design, excessive scale and bulk would be an unsympathetic and visually intrusive form of development, failing to respect the character and appearance of the hosting dwelling and the wider terrace, where such proposals are an uncharacteristic feature. The proposal is considered to be contrary to policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design led approach), policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, Stamford Hill AAP (Consultation version) policies AAP3 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), AAP6 (Delivering High Quality Design) and the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2009&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
